GIVEN `the instalment number` IS A NUMBER
      `the frequency`         IS A `A premium frequency`
      `the row`               IS A `A row of the Article 13.9(a) table`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`instalment` `the instalment number` `paid as` `the frequency` `falls in` `the row` MEANS
        `the row`'s `frequency` EQUALS `the frequency`
    ... `the instalment number` AT LEAST `the row`'s `first instalment`
    AND CONSIDER `the row`'s `last instalment`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
        WHEN JUST l  THEN `the instalment number` AT MOST l

@ref Article 13.9 a (src 617-662): the instalments are numbered from 1
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the Article 13.9(a) table has no row for that instalment number` MEANS
    REFUSE "the Article 13.9(a) table has no row for that instalment number"

@ref Article 13.9 a (src 617-662)
GIVEN `the instalment number` IS A NUMBER
      `the frequency`         IS A `A premium frequency`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the guaranteed maximum initial charge rate for instalment` `the instalment number` `paid as` `the frequency` MEANS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN r YIELD `instalment` `the instalment number` `paid as` `the frequency` `falls in` r) `the Article 13.9(a) table`
    WHEN EMPTY                  THEN `the Article 13.9(a) table has no row for that instalment number`
    WHEN r FOLLOWED BY `the rest` THEN r's `maximum initial charge rate`

@ref Article 13.9 a (src 617-662)
GIVEN `the instalment` IS A `A regular basic premium instalment`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 13.9(a) — the guaranteed maximum is kept by the initial charge rate on` `the instalment` MEANS
    `the instalment`'s `initial charge rate` AT MOST
        `the guaranteed maximum initial charge rate for instalment` (`the instalment`'s `instalment number`) `paid as` (`the instalment`'s `frequency`)

-- b. No initial charge on a top-up ("Miễn phí", free).
