-- src:664 | Miễn phí
@ref Article 13.9 b (src 663-664)
GIVEN `the top-up` IS A `A top-up premium`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 13.9(b) — the guaranteed maximum is kept by the initial charge rate on` `the top-up` MEANS
    `the top-up`'s `initial charge rate` AT MOST 0

-- c. and e. The policy fee and the switching fee may rise by at most 15% a year. Read as a
-- cap on each year's level against the level one year earlier (NOTES.md fork register:
-- year on year, not simple growth on the first level).
-- src:665 | c. Phí Quản lý Hợp đồng
-- src:666 | Áp dụng tỷ lệ tăng tối đa là 15% một năm
-- src:670 | e. Phí chuyển đổi quỹ
-- src:671 | Áp dụng tỷ lệ tăng tối đa là 15% một năm
@ref Article 13.9 c and e (src 665-666, 670-671)
GIVEN `the new level`          IS A NUMBER
      `the level a year before` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 13.9(c) and (e) — a fee of` `the new level` `is within the guaranteed maximum, against` `the level a year before` `a year before` MEANS
    `the new level` AT MOST `the level a year before` TIMES (100% PLUS 15%)

-- d. The standard risk premium rate: at most 200% of the standard mortality table the
-- Company is using for this product. That table is not in the document; its rate for the
-- Life Insured is an input (NOTES.md, findings: the cap moves with the Company's table).
-- src:667 | d. Tỉ lệ bảo hiểm rủi ro tiêu chuẩn
-- src:668 | 200% bảng tỷ lệ tử vong tiêu chuẩn Công ty đang
-- src:669 | sử dụng cho sản phẩm này.
@ref Article 13.9 d (src 667-669)
GIVEN `the rate`          IS A NUMBER
      `the standard rate` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 13.9(d) — a risk premium rate of` `the rate` `is within the guaranteed maximum, against a standard mortality rate of` `the standard rate` MEANS
    `the rate` AT MOST 200% TIMES `the standard rate`

-- f. The partial withdrawal fee, if any, equals the switching fee in the same year. Read
-- as a maximum, like every line under the 13.9 heading.
-- src:672 | f. Phí rút tiền mặt từng phần
-- src:676 | Phí rút tiền mặt từng phần nếu có bằng phí chuyển đổi
-- src:677 | quỹ trong năm tương ứng.
@ref Article 13.9 f (src 672, 676-677)
GIVEN `the partial withdrawal fee` IS A NUMBER
      `the switching fee`          IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 13.9(f) — a partial withdrawal fee of` `the partial withdrawal fee` `is within the guaranteed maximum, against a switching fee that year of` `the switching fee` MEANS
    `the partial withdrawal fee` AT MOST `the switching fee`

-- g. The bid-offer spread: at most 5%.
-- h. The fund management fee: at most 2.5% a year of the funds' account value. "2.5%" is
-- written with a point; the Vietnamese convention groups thousands with a point and writes
-- decimals with a comma, but a point followed by one digit cannot group thousands, so this
-- is two and a half per cent (NOTES.md fork register).
-- src:678 | g. Chênh lệch giá mua-giá bán
-- src:679 | 5%
-- src:680 | h. Phí quản lý quỹ 2.5% một năm tính trên giá trị tài
-- src:681 | khoản của các Quỹ.
@ref Article 13.9 g and h (src 678-681)
GIVEN `the charges` IS A `The charges in the Policy Schedule`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 13.9(g) and (h) — the guaranteed maxima are kept by the spread and the fund management fee in` `the charges` MEANS
        `the charges`'s `bid-offer spread` AT MOST 5%
    AND `the charges`'s `fund management fee rate per year` AT MOST 2.5%
